1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
(Amy:)She's right. But say the word, I got a lab
full of cocaine-addicted monkeys...

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,810
(Amy:)...with nothing to lose.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,290
(Amy:)One of them could end up
in the back seat of her car.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,330
(Amy:)Or her shower.

5
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,160
(Sheldon:)Ladies, ladies, please.
We're not here to talk about Penny.

6
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:21,120
(Sheldon:)We're here to talk about me.
I mean Einstein Von Brainstorm! Darn it.

7
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:23,640
(Sheldon:)All right, I guess the
cat's out of the bag.

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:27,210
(Sheldon:)Let me explain what's going on.
Ricardo is really Leon...

9
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,520
(Penny:)We know what's going on, Sheldon!

10
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,330
But what should I do?

11
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:35,370
(Bernadette:)Alex is your employee.
If she's doing something that's...

12
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,170
(Bernadette:)...making Leonard uncomfortable,
you should talk to her.

13
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:40,690
Oh, he's not uncomfortable at all.
He's loving it.

14
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,170
(Sheldon:)He's strutting around
like he's 5-foot-6.

15
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,490
(Penny:)What? He's loving it?

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,160
(Bernadette:)Sheldon, you need to talk to Alex
right away.

17
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,320
Talk to her. That's all you've got?

18
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:54,320
(Sheldon:)With a cool name like
Sheldon Cooper's Council of Ladies...

19
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,330
(Sheldon:)...I really expected more.

20
00:00:56,680 --> 00:01:10,030
(Sheldon:)Give me back the t-shirts.

